## 4. Difficulty: exactly 1.10× per level (strict)

### The rule

```
target D(n) = D(1) · 1.10^(n−1)
```

Use the same D formula already in `tools/difficulty.js` (aps, mech, combo, slack, rest, gap10 and the same weights a = 0.2, b = 0.15, c = 0.3, d = 0.5, e = 0.1). **Do not re-tune the weights to make the numbers fit.** Hit the targets by changing the levels: density, tempo, combos, mixing and tighter timing.

